              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín nari ooiyé', «Atén a xuaán adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, sagadiyusmoowós Mose ngura ádbáy múk baraá yaamuuká' nguwa hhaamisi, nee yaamuuká' ngiwa kuungá' i haniisi. Gawaá adoorihe atén ana da'ayuutaán. An gár adoorí ngisa tleehhaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala atén daxta a baraá dabaawók i diriiaán, tidá' hhoo' kuúng taa aán aténí tleehharo, tleehheek.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí an adoodá' Yoshua aa tleéhh. Inós múk Gibeoni guna baáq, nee inós sleeme aa ya/aniká múk Gibeoni kuwa tsu/i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá deelór niinawe Yoshua múk Gibeoni guri lawaale tleéhh ar migír feehhamis, nee ar ma'aay hhekw awa múk Israeli, nee awa kitángw ilahhooa kawa hanmiisi. Ay laarí inooín i kumamitiyá' gadiyeérihe, didá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aqo tsawaari as sluufmis.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.27"
            ]
          }
